1
00:01:30,365 --> 00:01:32,057
(Introduction of cell phones)

2
00:01:32,291 --> 00:01:33,978
Now's not the time to cry

3
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:35,125
Yukimura

4
00:01:35,165 --> 00:01:37,671
Didn't I say the school festival report was due today?

5
00:01:38,017 --> 00:01:39,929
Yes, but President

6
00:01:39,970 --> 00:01:42,118
there are just so many documents

7
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:43,733
And a lot of clubs waited until right before the deadline

8
00:01:43,774 --> 00:01:45,654
to submit their reports to us

9
00:01:46,947 --> 00:01:49,620
Some still haven't submitted theirs? I can't take this anymore

10
00:01:49,670 --> 00:01:52,391
It can't be helped, I'll handle the rest

11
00:01:52,805 --> 00:01:54,191
President

12
00:01:55,034 --> 00:01:56,123
So hot!

13
00:01:56,164 --> 00:01:57,478
Come take a look

14
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,680
Come on, stop it

15
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,953
This is so good!

16
00:01:59,994 --> 00:02:00,867
Seriously!

17
00:02:00,908 --> 00:02:02,594
I can't hold back anymore!

18
00:02:03,358 --> 00:02:05,158
Why is it so noisy on your end?

19
00:02:05,198 --> 00:02:06,543
What are they doing?

20
00:02:06,884 --> 00:02:07,884
Nothing

21
00:02:11,246 --> 00:02:12,845
-Awesome...
-Awesome...

22
00:02:13,712 --> 00:02:16,256
Do you idiots have a death wish or something?

23
00:02:16,343 --> 00:02:19,106
How dare you look at that sleazy stuff while I'm away?

24
00:02:20,026 --> 00:02:21,628
Tell them this for me

25
00:02:25,576 --> 00:02:27,154
I will punish them

26
00:02:32,383 --> 00:02:33,827
No, President!

27
00:02:34,327 --> 00:02:36,112
What do you mean, "I will punish them"?

28
00:02:36,162 --> 00:02:38,041
Saying something that turns people on like that

29
00:02:38,117 --> 00:02:41,121
When did you... Why did you just walk in here?

30
00:02:41,491 --> 00:02:43,251
It wasn't even locked

31
00:02:43,364 --> 00:02:44,695
What an airhead

32
00:02:45,421 --> 00:02:46,901
-Why you!
-Ouch!

33
00:02:47,027 --> 00:02:48,673
Usui, you're here again?

34
00:02:48,714 --> 00:02:50,007
What's in that box?

35
00:02:50,335 --> 00:02:52,742
I collected them from other places

36
00:02:53,858 --> 00:02:55,056
Self-defense goods?

37
00:02:55,106 --> 00:02:57,966
Well... do you know about what happened recently?

38
00:02:58,189 --> 00:03:00,521
A cosplay cafe employee got stalked

39
00:03:00,562 --> 00:03:02,522
It sounds pretty scary

40
00:03:02,898 --> 00:03:03,830
So...

41
00:03:04,209 --> 00:03:06,781
Personally, I think our regular masters are fine

42
00:03:06,930 --> 00:03:09,738
but just in case, you should keep some too, Misa-chan

43
00:03:10,077 --> 00:03:10,855
Here

44
00:03:11,591 --> 00:03:13,086
Hand them out to the other girls first

45
00:03:13,136 --> 00:03:14,718
I'll just take whatever's left

46
00:03:14,769 --> 00:03:16,366
I'm not really worried about being in danger anyway

47
00:03:16,407 --> 00:03:19,261
You're not in danger because you think you can fight?

48
00:03:20,396 --> 00:03:21,561
Oh, right

49
00:03:21,602 --> 00:03:24,138
Misa-chan knows aikido, doesn't she?

50
00:03:24,294 --> 00:03:25,062
That's right

51
00:03:25,102 --> 00:03:28,112
Besides, nobody's ever tried to ambush me after work

52
00:03:28,162 --> 00:03:30,815
If a creep shows up, I'll just catch him

53
00:03:32,056 --> 00:03:34,299
You're so dependable, Misa-chan!

54
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:38,072
"First Time Watching the Shop"

55
00:03:41,617 --> 00:03:42,971
That stalking incident, right?

56
00:03:43,186 --> 00:03:46,046
The one at that cosplay cafe, it was on the news

57
00:03:46,339 --> 00:03:47,664
That guy is awful

58
00:03:47,714 --> 00:03:49,092
Totally unacceptable

59
00:03:49,187 --> 00:03:51,259
I wonder if Misa-chan will be okay

60
00:03:52,179 --> 00:03:53,252
She's really...

61
00:03:53,293 --> 00:03:54,392
(Bad premonition)

62
00:03:54,433 --> 00:03:55,671
-I'm so worried
-I'm so worried

63
00:03:55,721 --> 00:03:58,172
-If anything happens to Misa-chan...
-If anything happens to Misa-chan...

64
00:03:58,213 --> 00:04:01,172
Right, shouldn't we go protect Misa-chan?

65
00:04:01,758 --> 00:04:03,398
But Misa-chan is such a good fighter

66
00:04:03,439 --> 00:04:04,773
She knows aikido

67
00:04:04,887 --> 00:04:06,745
And she's way stronger than us

68
00:04:06,966 --> 00:04:08,380
-No need to worry...
-No need to worry...

69
00:04:08,878 --> 00:04:10,905
Alright, so are we going today?

70
00:04:10,962 --> 00:04:12,295
Are we going to Maid Latte?

71
00:04:12,345 --> 00:04:14,530
Let's order a coffee and stay all day

72
00:04:19,421 --> 00:04:21,363
President, go easy on us!

73
00:04:21,413 --> 00:04:23,468
Everyone who was watching dirty stuff in the student council room...

74
00:04:23,508 --> 00:04:24,535
is here, right?

75
00:04:24,576 --> 00:04:25,619
(Bodies strewn everywhere)

76
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:26,340
Yes...

77
00:04:26,391 --> 00:04:27,503
We've learned our lesson

78
00:04:27,553 --> 00:04:29,175
President, we're so sorry

79
00:04:30,669 --> 00:04:33,093
If you have time to fool around like this

80
00:04:33,134 --> 00:04:35,220
how about you go straight home and study!

81
00:04:35,261 --> 00:04:36,234
-Yes
-Yes

82
00:04:36,275 --> 00:04:37,242
She really is incredible

83
00:04:40,657 --> 00:04:42,343
What are you doing here?

84
00:04:52,019 --> 00:04:53,526
What's his deal?

85
00:04:53,608 --> 00:04:54,968
Tacky and gross

86
00:04:55,293 --> 00:04:56,600
Whatever, do whatever you want

87
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:58,166
-Stupid Usui!
-Usui!

88
00:04:58,313 --> 00:05:00,021
What an idiot

89
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:07,481
(After school)

90
00:05:07,776 --> 00:05:09,982
-Yay
-Yay

91
00:05:10,074 --> 00:05:12,001
-School's out!
-School's out!

92
00:05:12,042 --> 00:05:13,589
Yay...

93
00:05:14,469 --> 00:05:16,173
Ikuto, how much money do you have?

94
00:05:16,213 --> 00:05:18,151
20 yen. What about you, Shiroyan?

95
00:05:18,201 --> 00:05:20,067
80 yen. Kurotatsu?

96
00:05:20,118 --> 00:05:21,593
I have a whopping 15 yen

97
00:05:21,634 --> 00:05:23,790
How much do the three of us have together?

98
00:05:23,831 --> 00:05:25,951
That would be 115 yen

99
00:05:25,992 --> 00:05:28,998
Oh, that's not even enough for a cup of coffee

100
00:05:30,985 --> 00:05:32,752
Guess we're just going home today

101
00:05:34,359 --> 00:05:36,176
(Student council room)

102
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:51,054
Stamp...

103
00:05:51,806 --> 00:05:54,739
Stamp...

104
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,905
-All done
-President

105
00:05:58,955 --> 00:06:00,573
Thank you so much

106
00:06:00,801 --> 00:06:02,911
Thanks for your hard work, Yukimura

107
00:06:07,341 --> 00:06:08,860
And it got so late too

108
00:06:30,023 --> 00:06:31,462
Things went really smoothly

109
00:06:31,503 --> 00:06:32,762
Sakura?

110
00:06:33,147 --> 00:06:34,176
Oh?

111
00:06:34,629 --> 00:06:37,487
Misaki, you're only leaving now?

112
00:06:38,449 --> 00:06:41,011
Huh, doing homework at school? Why?

113
00:06:41,062 --> 00:06:43,517
Because I can concentrate better this way

114
00:06:43,830 --> 00:06:46,417
You never know what might happen out on the streets at night

115
00:06:46,877 --> 00:06:49,137
A girl shouldn't be walking home alone this late

116
00:06:49,187 --> 00:06:50,284
Okay

117
00:06:52,728 --> 00:06:54,721
You're like a mom, Misaki

118
00:06:54,921 --> 00:06:56,368
Thanks for walking me home

119
00:07:01,545 --> 00:07:03,258
Are you really clueless, or just playing dumb?

120
00:07:07,833 --> 00:07:10,685
You never know what might happen out on the streets at night

121
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,540
Don't go walking alone so late at night, you know

122
00:07:15,736 --> 00:07:17,985
You jerk, don't cross the line!

123
00:07:18,083 --> 00:07:19,135
I'm going to work, okay?

124
00:07:19,185 --> 00:07:20,646
Stop following me!

125
00:07:22,848 --> 00:07:25,699
Welcome home, Master!

126
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:27,311
I'm home

127
00:07:27,432 --> 00:07:29,495
Right this way, Master

128
00:07:29,708 --> 00:07:30,779
Okay

129
00:07:36,771 --> 00:07:38,009
Just pretend he isn't here

130
00:07:52,670 --> 00:07:54,628
Let me get you a fresh one

131
00:07:55,259 --> 00:07:56,980
Thanks so much, Misa-chan

132
00:08:04,317 --> 00:08:05,626
I'll be heading out now

133
00:08:05,725 --> 00:08:07,210
-Take care
-Take care

134
00:08:07,547 --> 00:08:09,269
The manager's taking so long to get back

135
00:08:09,341 --> 00:08:11,328
She went to a meeting with the shopping district

136
00:08:11,414 --> 00:08:12,761
Nothing we can do about it

137
00:08:14,013 --> 00:08:15,522
And on today of all days...

138
00:08:15,704 --> 00:08:18,316
Huh? Erika, what do you have going on today?

139
00:08:18,366 --> 00:08:21,363
I have homework due tomorrow, but I haven't even touched it

140
00:08:22,596 --> 00:08:24,176
There's no way I'll finish it in time!

141
00:08:24,436 --> 00:08:26,778
Oh right, Subaru, do you have plans too?

142
00:08:27,768 --> 00:08:30,623
I have another part-time job to get to after this

143
00:08:31,350 --> 00:08:32,993
You're so hardworking

144
00:08:33,078 --> 00:08:34,395
Don't worry about it

145
00:08:35,197 --> 00:08:37,393
Why don't you two clock out now?

146
00:08:37,444 --> 00:08:39,923
I'll explain it to the manager later

147
00:08:39,963 --> 00:08:41,623
-Are you sure, Misa-chan?
-Are you sure, Misa-chan?

148
00:08:41,673 --> 00:08:43,497
It's totally fine, leave it to me

149
00:08:43,589 --> 00:08:46,258
That'd really help us out, but it doesn't feel right

150
00:08:46,299 --> 00:08:47,985
Just leaving you behind like this feels kind of...

151
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:50,696
Especially with all those creepy things happening lately

152
00:08:50,835 --> 00:08:51,702
Yeah

153
00:08:51,781 --> 00:08:53,060
Don't worry

154
00:08:53,115 --> 00:08:54,954
If any weirdos try following me...

155
00:08:54,994 --> 00:08:56,700
I'll definitely catch them

156
00:08:56,851 --> 00:08:58,221
Are you really sure?

157
00:08:58,271 --> 00:08:59,141
I'm good

158
00:08:59,192 --> 00:09:00,808
Then we'll be heading out

159
00:09:00,859 --> 00:09:01,979
We owe you one

160
00:09:05,590 --> 00:09:07,951
Gotta lock this up tight. All done

161
00:09:36,621 --> 00:09:38,266
The stalker the manager mentioned...

162
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,721
What a strong grip...

163
00:09:59,971 --> 00:10:02,245
Usui, it's you? What are you doing?

164
00:10:02,296 --> 00:10:03,840
Playing the stalker

165
00:10:04,370 --> 00:10:07,845
Looks like I need to teach you that you've gone too far

166
00:10:07,886 --> 00:10:09,042
As a punishment?

167
00:10:10,684 --> 00:10:12,084
Do you have any idea, Usui?

168
00:10:12,125 --> 00:10:14,863
Any other girl would report you to the police

169
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:17,337
I only got in because the door outside wasn't locked

170
00:10:18,502 --> 00:10:21,727
Madam President, you really should be more careful yourself

171
00:10:22,774 --> 00:10:24,778
Don't let your guard down just because you know how to fight

172
00:10:30,185 --> 00:10:32,452
You're still a girl, after all

173
00:10:37,143 --> 00:10:38,391
Let go of me!

174
00:10:39,515 --> 00:10:41,509
You always have to treat me like an idiot

175
00:10:41,590 --> 00:10:43,327
What was that? Were you trying to warn me?

176
00:10:43,512 --> 00:10:45,533
I know very well I need to be careful!

177
00:10:52,877 --> 00:10:53,706
Just leave!

178
00:10:57,933 --> 00:10:58,942
Bye

179
00:11:07,754 --> 00:11:10,480
She has no idea what's really going on

180
00:11:37,089 --> 00:11:40,015
Wow, incredible! That's so much cake!

181
00:11:40,142 --> 00:11:42,489
Big Sis, what's this? Wasn't this really expensive?

182
00:11:42,539 --> 00:11:43,675
Why are you splurging so much today?

183
00:11:43,716 --> 00:11:46,095
Because the manager at Maid Latte went out today

184
00:11:46,146 --> 00:11:47,897
and I stayed behind to watch the shop

185
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:50,185
I'm so sorry I'm back so late

186
00:11:50,235 --> 00:11:51,855
Take these home to eat, okay?

187
00:11:51,906 --> 00:11:53,409
So I just brought them home

188
00:11:56,813 --> 00:11:59,280
Still, that idiot Usui...

189
00:11:59,395 --> 00:12:02,267
always acts so smug, constantly looking down on people

190
00:12:02,539 --> 00:12:06,836
-Well, even if I'm annoyed with him, there's nothing I can do
-Save this piece for Mom, and this piece for tomorrow afternoon

191
00:12:06,995 --> 00:12:09,142
-Wow, this cake is delicious!
-This piece is for a late-night snack

192
00:12:09,183 --> 00:12:12,443
-I wonder where the manager bought them
-Now I don't know which one to eat first

193
00:12:12,837 --> 00:12:13,600
Suzuna

194
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:16,185
Eat whichever one you like, they're really good

195
00:12:16,729 --> 00:12:19,229
Come to think of it, it'd go even better with tea

196
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,414
Good point

197
00:12:20,455 --> 00:12:23,990
Conveniently enough, I just won
a world precious teas sampler set!

198
00:12:24,976 --> 00:12:26,109
Thanks so much

199
00:12:26,803 --> 00:12:29,518
(The next day, after school)

200
00:12:30,205 --> 00:12:31,938
Want to go hang out somewhere?

201
00:12:32,132 --> 00:12:34,084
I'm not going out, I'm broke

202
00:12:34,261 --> 00:12:35,369
All right then

203
00:12:42,572 --> 00:12:44,876
All right then, Master, take care on your way out

204
00:12:48,374 --> 00:12:50,283
Have you decided on your order?

205
00:12:50,447 --> 00:12:53,823
I'll have the Moe Moe Omelet Rice and an iced coffee

206
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:54,893
Right away

207
00:12:54,933 --> 00:12:56,706
-Moe Moe Omelet Rice and an iced coffee, right?
-It's so peaceful

208
00:12:56,747 --> 00:12:59,975
-Without Usui around, my mind is so at peace
-Yes, thank you very much

209
00:13:00,491 --> 00:13:01,293
Coming right up

210
00:13:04,915 --> 00:13:07,005
-Oops
-Oops

211
00:13:07,404 --> 00:13:09,594
I-I'm so sorry, my hand bumped...

212
00:13:09,833 --> 00:13:11,121
I'm so sorry!

213
00:13:11,321 --> 00:13:12,930
Are you okay? Did you hurt yourself?

214
00:13:12,997 --> 00:13:14,377
Uh... I'm fine

215
00:13:14,417 --> 00:13:17,019
I'll be right back with a cloth to wipe that up, Master

216
00:13:20,718 --> 00:13:22,090
L-Let me help you

217
00:13:24,286 --> 00:13:25,810
Careful, don't cut yourself!

218
00:13:27,673 --> 00:13:28,503
Right...

219
00:13:32,454 --> 00:13:34,911
Misa-chan is the ideal target

220
00:13:34,952 --> 00:13:37,706
Yeah, I really can't hold back anymore

221
00:13:46,025 --> 00:13:47,015
A young woman

222
00:13:47,055 --> 00:13:49,412
was recently assaulted at a café in the city

223
00:13:50,859 --> 00:13:53,914
The incident took place at a café commonly known as a cosplay café

224
00:13:53,995 --> 00:13:55,656
At closing time, the culprit

225
00:13:55,747 --> 00:13:58,147
broke into the shop through the staff entrance

226
00:13:58,371 --> 00:14:00,329
Hey there, handsome

227
00:14:00,916 --> 00:14:03,451
Are you free? Want to come hang out with us?

228
00:14:03,986 --> 00:14:06,848
You look so young, are you a high schooler?

229
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,777
-Oops
-Hey!

230
00:14:12,614 --> 00:14:13,838
Tch, shot down

231
00:14:13,889 --> 00:14:15,407
This is so boring

232
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,604
All done inside

233
00:14:24,154 --> 00:14:26,043
The manager has a key too

234
00:14:26,866 --> 00:14:28,303
Just to be safe...

235
00:14:29,085 --> 00:14:32,315
Tonight, I have to go to those shopping district meetings again

236
00:14:32,365 --> 00:14:35,307
All the meetings are this month, and aside from regular meetings

237
00:14:35,357 --> 00:14:38,370
there's an opinion exchange and a financial consultation meeting

238
00:14:38,413 --> 00:14:40,467
And I have to submit the account books

239
00:14:40,518 --> 00:14:42,723
Account books are such a pain

240
00:14:42,774 --> 00:14:44,934
And on top of that, the head of the shopping district association said

241
00:14:44,985 --> 00:14:47,755
It's time to change our exclusive mascot

242
00:14:47,805 --> 00:14:50,795
And then he pulled out all these bizarre dolls

243
00:14:50,845 --> 00:14:53,235
No, this won't do. How about I sing a song? La la la

244
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:56,617
Anyway, next time I definitely won't
leave you to close up alone

245
00:14:56,668 --> 00:15:00,022
If anything happens tonight, you'll have to handle it yourself

246
00:15:00,067 --> 00:15:02,823
As soon as the meeting ends, I'll bring some cake right back

247
00:15:02,879 --> 00:15:03,787
I'm so sorry!

248
00:15:03,838 --> 00:15:06,002
It's fine, really, don't worry about it, Manager

249
00:15:08,015 --> 00:15:11,227
Man, the manager's such a mess, it really makes me worry

250
00:15:11,268 --> 00:15:12,724
(Self-defense gear)

251
00:15:18,744 --> 00:15:21,549
Ouch, that hurts even more than I thought!

252
00:15:23,167 --> 00:15:24,359
Manager?

253
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:29,443
Manager?

254
00:15:29,631 --> 00:15:33,000
Oh, I thought I heard a door opening...

255
00:15:33,041 --> 00:15:34,667
(Firmly locked)

256
00:15:37,956 --> 00:15:39,301
Misa-chan

257
00:15:39,908 --> 00:15:41,431
Wait, the back door was open?

258
00:15:41,481 --> 00:15:42,544
Don't move

259
00:15:47,782 --> 00:15:49,118
Let's head up to the second floor first

260
00:16:06,236 --> 00:16:08,120
All right then, Misa-chan

261
00:16:08,575 --> 00:16:10,672
Be a good girl for a bit, okay?

262
00:16:11,203 --> 00:16:13,173
We don't want to hurt you

263
00:16:13,343 --> 00:16:14,677
That's right

264
00:16:15,828 --> 00:16:17,964
These two are customers from the café

265
00:16:31,005 --> 00:16:32,085
Misa-chan

266
00:16:35,872 --> 00:16:37,348
You know, don't you?

267
00:16:44,121 --> 00:16:46,034
To me, Misa-chan...

268
00:16:47,085 --> 00:16:48,981
you're the ideal maid

269
00:16:50,722 --> 00:16:53,103
We've been watching you all this time, Misa-chan

270
00:16:53,486 --> 00:16:56,171
Even when you're talking to other guys

271
00:16:56,601 --> 00:16:59,607
You don't really want to cater to them, do you?

272
00:17:10,309 --> 00:17:12,472
W-We're completely different from them

273
00:17:12,921 --> 00:17:15,418
We know the real you, Misa-chan

274
00:17:27,733 --> 00:17:30,575
You guys need to keep your daydreaming in check!

275
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:33,115
What do you mean, you know the real me?

276
00:17:33,243 --> 00:17:36,167
What's the big deal? What could you possibly know?

277
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,415
Just give up!

278
00:17:57,345 --> 00:17:59,290
You two are total scumbags!

279
00:18:06,969 --> 00:18:07,944
Usui?

280
00:18:08,666 --> 00:18:10,290
The window!

281
00:18:17,034 --> 00:18:19,655
If the manager sees this, she'll pass out for sure!

282
00:18:20,063 --> 00:18:22,464
The back door was locked, after all

283
00:18:22,646 --> 00:18:23,870
Couldn't be helped

284
00:18:26,509 --> 00:18:28,656
-I'm sorry...
-I'm sorry...

285
00:18:29,147 --> 00:18:30,603
By the way, you two

286
00:18:30,643 --> 00:18:32,689
You said earlier that you knew her true side

287
00:18:32,730 --> 00:18:34,404
So what is she actually like?

288
00:18:35,395 --> 00:18:36,611
I'm curious

289
00:18:36,774 --> 00:18:38,398
Uh... well...

290
00:18:38,577 --> 00:18:40,344
Even though she's a maid...

291
00:18:40,503 --> 00:18:42,479
she's actually a total sadist

292
00:18:43,629 --> 00:18:47,533
So that's why we wanted to try getting punished by her

293
00:18:51,009 --> 00:18:53,021
Meaning you guys are masochists?

294
00:18:53,707 --> 00:18:55,722
-Yeah
-We're being true to ourselves!

295
00:18:59,888 --> 00:19:01,314
Too bad

296
00:19:01,489 --> 00:19:04,841
This cute maid is mine to keep

297
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,333
I'm not lending her to anyone

298
00:19:09,786 --> 00:19:11,244
Why didn't I know...

299
00:19:11,561 --> 00:19:13,743
that I was being kept by you, Usui?

300
00:19:33,858 --> 00:19:35,904
Never mind that, but...

301
00:19:36,211 --> 00:19:39,194
Saying what needed to be said

302
00:19:39,369 --> 00:19:42,375
was the right thing to do

303
00:19:45,264 --> 00:19:46,311
Usui...

304
00:19:48,558 --> 00:19:49,719
Thank you

305
00:19:58,338 --> 00:20:00,028
Misa-chan

306
00:20:00,078 --> 00:20:02,403
Sorry to keep you so late again

307
00:20:02,506 --> 00:20:05,319
Oh, Usui, you're here too?

308
00:20:05,533 --> 00:20:07,655
Manager, you're back?

309
00:20:08,358 --> 00:20:08,842
I see...

310
00:20:08,893 --> 00:20:11,014
Were you two just gazing at each other?

311
00:20:11,064 --> 00:20:12,557
Sorry for interrupting

312
00:20:12,597 --> 00:20:14,507
Would've been better if I came back later, huh?

313
00:20:14,557 --> 00:20:16,467
I really have terrible timing

314
00:20:16,517 --> 00:20:18,284
What are you talking about, Manager?

315
00:20:18,806 --> 00:20:20,623
Usui, what's wrong? Up there...?

316
00:20:24,694 --> 00:20:27,117
Whoa, what happened?!

317
00:20:27,417 --> 00:20:28,376
I'm so sorry

318
00:20:28,417 --> 00:20:29,437
Actually...

319
00:20:30,476 --> 00:20:31,482
Manager

320
00:20:32,666 --> 00:20:33,975
(A few days later)

321
00:20:34,569 --> 00:20:36,935
So did you scream in terror?

322
00:20:37,614 --> 00:20:38,922
"Help me!"

323
00:20:38,962 --> 00:20:40,899
Like a proper girl

324
00:20:41,001 --> 00:20:43,229
Nope, I beat them up

325
00:20:43,308 --> 00:20:44,702
I figured as much

326
00:20:44,743 --> 00:20:46,647
Still, at least you weren't hurt

327
00:20:46,864 --> 00:20:48,998
Don't be so reckless again, got it?

328
00:20:49,837 --> 00:20:52,313
Sorry for making you all worry so much

329
00:20:52,393 --> 00:20:53,860
I'm totally fine now though

330
00:20:53,910 --> 00:20:56,289
I'm gonna get even stronger!

331
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:59,364
That's so like Misa-chan

332
00:20:59,818 --> 00:21:02,036
That's our Misa-chan

333
00:21:04,197 --> 00:21:06,422
If you get any better at fighting, what are we gonna do?

334
00:21:06,463 --> 00:21:07,654
That's what everyone's thinking

335
00:21:07,873 --> 00:21:09,035
All right

336
00:21:09,479 --> 00:21:11,516
Someone sent this to me the other day

337
00:21:11,557 --> 00:21:13,651
Those photos of Misa-chan from before

338
00:21:19,731 --> 00:21:21,698
Wh-When were those taken?

339
00:21:21,748 --> 00:21:23,180
You should be asking who took them

340
00:21:23,231 --> 00:21:24,805
Yep, I took them

341
00:21:24,846 --> 00:21:26,425
If something's cute, share it with the world

342
00:21:26,476 --> 00:21:28,313
That's the manager's motto

343
00:21:28,617 --> 00:21:30,390
The manager took a ton too

344
00:21:30,431 --> 00:21:32,434
Enough to fill an entire memory card

345
00:21:32,862 --> 00:21:35,129
Which one? Let me see

346
00:21:37,046 --> 00:21:38,283
She really is adorable

347
00:21:38,324 --> 00:21:39,060
Usui, you can't look!

348
00:21:39,101 --> 00:21:41,103
Send it to me too, hurry

349
00:21:41,308 --> 00:21:41,871
Hey...

350
00:21:42,755 --> 00:21:43,678
Ta-da!

351
00:21:43,729 --> 00:21:45,375
I saved the photo too

352
00:21:45,426 --> 00:21:46,598
Stop messing around!

353
00:21:46,648 --> 00:21:47,713
Give it to me

354
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:49,525
No way, no way!

355
00:21:49,835 --> 00:21:53,170
Wait a second, h-how do I change it?

356
00:21:53,226 --> 00:21:55,474
Huh? If I can't change the wallpaper...

357
00:21:55,558 --> 00:21:58,083
It's so embarrassing, how am I supposed to use this phone?

358
00:21:58,133 --> 00:21:59,387
How do I change it?

359
00:21:59,437 --> 00:22:01,766
Come on, tell me! Teach me!

360
00:22:01,817 --> 00:22:04,697
-If you don't change it yourself, you'll never learn how to use the phone
-How do I change it?!

361
00:22:04,788 --> 00:22:06,757
-There, I sent it
-No!

362
00:22:06,865 --> 00:22:08,059
All done

363
00:23:41,876 --> 00:23:44,226
Sis, those cakes were so good

364
00:23:44,266 --> 00:23:46,860
Please thank the manager for me

365
00:23:47,098 --> 00:23:49,874
I already did, and from Mom too

366
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:52,835
I have a feeling we'll be getting more cake

367
00:23:53,420 --> 00:23:55,521
-There's no point getting your hopes up
-President

368
00:23:55,561 --> 00:23:57,585
I've saved up enough Maid Latte points

369
00:23:57,626 --> 00:23:58,985
You come here way too often, Usui

370
00:23:59,025 --> 00:24:00,676
Misa-chan, let's take a photo together

371
00:24:00,717 --> 00:24:03,026
Beat me in a game first, then we'll talk

372
00:24:03,452 --> 00:24:05,588
You sure looked impressive this time, President

373
00:24:05,639 --> 00:24:07,475
Getting called Master and all

374
00:24:08,276 --> 00:24:09,961
I don't know anything about that!
